Users should have the ability to set a Start Date of a Group to dates in the past and in the future.

User can go back up to 1 fiscal year from CG creation

User can go up to 3 years in the future - starting from Today

The system should fetch when the Campaign Group was created. The user should have the ability to set a Start Date spanning up to one fiscal year in the past starting from the Campaign Group Creation date. For example: If the Campaign Group was created on July 15 2022, the last date that the date picker should show is January 1 2021. If the Campaign Group was created on March 10 2023, the last date that the date picker should show is January 1 2022, and so on.

