Linking/Mapping: To successfully associate a Group and Strategy and perform the KR mapping, the user performing the action typically needs both MANAGE_GROUP_ASSOCIATIONS (on the Group) AND MANAGE_STRATEGY_ASSOCIATIONS (on the Strategy).

