When the user switches between recurrence types (e.g., monthly to quarterly or yearly), the system must recalculate the CG budget distribution and validate all associated strategies against the updated budget structure.

2.1 From Monthly to Quarterly

Behavior:

Combine the budgets of the three months into one quarter.

Existing strategies must align with the new quarterly allocation.

