Total Allocation (January): $30,000.

New Monthly Budget: $20,000.

Validation: Fails. Strategy budgets must be reduced or reallocated.

2.3 From Any Recurrence to Yearly

Behavior:

Combine all budgets into a single yearly allocation.

Validate existing strategies against the yearly limit.

Impact:

Recalculation:

Monthly Budget: $20,000/month → Yearly Budget: $240,000.

Quarterly Budget: $60,000 → Yearly Budget: $240,000.

