Real-Time Budget Adjustments:

Dynamically recalculate remaining budgets based on the updated CG budget and recurrence.

Provide real-time feedback for strategy alignment.

Validation Rules:

Block CG budget updates if the total allocated budget exceeds the new limit.

Require users to adjust impacted strategy budgets before proceeding.

