(This scenario is implicitly handled by the core pro-rating logic in Scenarios 1 & 7) The calculation of Available CG Budget sums the available portions period-by-period. If the total Strategy Planned Budget exceeds the total calculated Available CG Budget (which accounts for limits in specific periods), the blocking error in Scenario 1 will trigger. No separate warning mechanism is strictly needed if the main validation is robust.

