(Logic unchanged) No budget ceiling to validate against.

Handling: Allow strategy creation/saving but display a prominent non-blocking warning: "Campaign Group budget is not defined. The Strategy's planned budget cannot be validated against limits. Proceed with caution." Flag strategy.

